 ?[samples_review]: "p8 is chosen and routed to citation-navigation; are the p9, p10, and p11 samples in syntax-hardware-alignment the forms the conventions passes should apply?"
 ?[provenance_home]: "tree/provenance holds a review scorecard and errata logs, which record what was found on days; do they move to the journal once refs are anchor-addressed and a move no longer rewrites paths?"
}

