 ~[journal_entry_lens]: "&[lsp] — journal-aware: a journal entry shows its date and kind from its ^[entry] frame in hover and a code lens, and an entry moved in whole shows where it came from"
 ~[journal_append_only]: "&[lsp] — journal-aware: an edit to an entry after its day raises a warning that names the supersedes path; the journal index, moves frames, and path fixes the journal made are exempt"
 ~[journal_backlinks]: "&[lsp] — journal-aware, after citation-navigation ~[root_anchor_refs] and apposition-cache-granules ~[pin_cache_defects]: a tree surface shows the journal entries that cite it, its instances and receipts, as backlinks"
